#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we will use a Qiskit reference primitive called the StatevectorSampler. A sampler is a primitive designed to sample all the possible states of a system and return probabilities (or in some cases, quasiprobabilities) of obtaining each state. We can specify a number of \"shots\", and look at the \"counts\" for each state.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang kita akan menggunakan primitive Qiskit reference bernama StatevectorSampler. Sampler adalah primitive yang dirancang untuk mengambil sampel semua kemungkinan keadaan suatu sistem dan mengembalikan probabilitas (atau dalam beberapa kasus, kuasi-probabilitas) untuk mendapatkan setiap keadaan. Kita bisa menentukan jumlah \"shots\", dan melihat \"counts\" untuk setiap keadaan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If we look at the counts from each circuit, we see that two of them were basically identical, and the third was quite different.\n"
