msgstr "Konsep kritis: {#critical-concepts}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There was a historical disagreement about whether quantum states were merely unknown or undetermined by nature prior to measurement, whether quantum mechanics is deterministic or probabilistic.\n"
msgstr "Ada perselisihan historis tentang apakah keadaan kuantum hanya tidak diketahui atau belum ditentukan oleh alam sebelum pengukuran, apakah mekanika kuantum bersifat deterministik atau probabilistik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hidden variables and therefore local realism are not consistent with observations of quantum mechanics. That is, the correlations observed in quantum mechanics cannot be explained by well-defined variables that are simply unknown to us.\n"
msgstr "Variabel tersembunyi dan karenanya realisme lokal tidak konsisten dengan pengamatan mekanika kuantum. Artinya, korelasi yang diamati dalam mekanika kuantum tidak bisa dijelaskan oleh variabel-variabel yang terdefinisi dengan baik yang hanya tidak diketahui oleh kita.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum mechanics is probabilistic.\n"
msgstr "Mekanika kuantum bersifat probabilistik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Entanglement is real and observable.\n"
msgstr "Entanglement nyata dan bisa diamati.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Entanglement is not just correlations.\n"
msgstr "Entanglement bukan sekadar korelasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We can map real world scenarios to quantum computers.\n"
msgstr "Kita bisa memetakan skenario dunia nyata ke komputer kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hidden variables refers to quantities specified by nature, but unknown to humans; they do not exist in this context.\n"
msgstr "Variabel tersembunyi merujuk pada kuantitas yang ditentukan oleh alam, tetapi tidak diketahui manusia; mereka tidak ada dalam konteks ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F questions: {#tf-questions}"
msgstr "Pertanyaan B/S: {#tf-questions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F Albert Einstein argued that quantum mechanics was incomplete, as a theory, because it only described probabilities of outcomes, and not the underlying mechanism that determined those outcomes.\n"
msgstr "B/S Albert Einstein berpendapat bahwa mekanika kuantum tidak lengkap sebagai teori, karena hanya menggambarkan probabilitas hasil, dan bukan mekanisme dasar yang menentukan hasil tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F \"Hidden variables\" refers to the idea that two quantum mechanical particles can be entangled.\n"
msgstr "B/S \"Variabel tersembunyi\" merujuk pada gagasan bahwa dua partikel mekanika kuantum bisa terjerat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F Any two correlated systems are quantum mechanically entangled.\n"
msgstr "B/S Dua sistem yang berkorelasi pasti terjerat secara kuantum mekanik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F Quantum mechanical entanglement is important for getting math right, but you can't see it in an experiment.\n"
msgstr "B/S Entanglement mekanika kuantum penting untuk mendapatkan matematika yang benar, tetapi tidak bisa diamati dalam eksperimen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F In most cases, quantum mechanics can't tell you an exact outcome of an experiment, only the probabilities that certain outcomes will be measured.\n"
msgstr "B/S Dalam kebanyakan kasus, mekanika kuantum tidak bisa memberi tahu kamu hasil pasti dari suatu eksperimen, hanya probabilitas bahwa hasil tertentu akan diukur.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F In quantum mechanics, under certain conditions, the state of particle A can be affected by the state of particle B, even if particles A and B are not in contact and do not exchange any particles.\n"
msgstr "B/S Dalam mekanika kuantum, dalam kondisi tertentu, keadaan partikel A bisa dipengaruhi oleh keadaan partikel B, meskipun partikel A dan B tidak bersentuhan dan tidak bertukar partikel apapun.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F We can map real world experiments onto quantum circuits.\n"
msgstr "B/S Kita bisa memetakan eksperimen dunia nyata ke quantum circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "MC questions: {#mc-questions}"
msgstr "Pertanyaan pilihan ganda: {#mc-questions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Suppose a spin-0 particle decays into two spin-1/2 particles A and B. A measurement is made on particle A that reveals its spin has a projection along $+z$. Particle B now\n"
msgstr "Misalkan sebuah partikel spin-0 meluruh menjadi dua partikel spin-1/2 A dan B. Sebuah pengukuran dilakukan pada partikel A yang mengungkapkan bahwa spinnya memiliki proyeksi sepanjang $+z$. Partikel B sekarang\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "a. definitely has a spin projection along $-z$\n"
msgstr "a. pasti memiliki proyeksi spin sepanjang $-z$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "b. definitely has a spin projection along $-x$\n"
msgstr "b. pasti memiliki proyeksi spin sepanjang $-x$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "c. definitely has a spin projection along $-y$\n"
msgstr "c. pasti memiliki proyeksi spin sepanjang $-y$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "d. definitely has a negative spin projection along any axis measured.\n"
msgstr "d. pasti memiliki proyeksi spin negatif sepanjang sumbu apapun yang diukur.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A spin-0 particle decays into two spin-1/2 particles A and B. If particle A is measured to have a projection along $+z$, which of the following projections are possible for a measurement of particle B? Circle all that apply.\n"
msgstr "Sebuah partikel spin-0 meluruh menjadi dua partikel spin-1/2 A dan B. Jika partikel A diukur memiliki proyeksi sepanjang $+z$, mana dari proyeksi berikut yang mungkin untuk pengukuran partikel B? Lingkari semua yang berlaku.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "a. $+x$\n"
msgstr "a. $+x$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "b. $-x$\n"
msgstr "b. $-x$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "c. $+y$\n"
msgstr "c. $+y$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "d. $-y$\n"
msgstr "d. $-y$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "e. $+z$\n"
msgstr "e. $+z$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "f. $-z$\n"
msgstr "f. $-z$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Suppose a spin-0 particle decays into two spin-1/2 particles A and B. What best describes the state of particle A prior to any measurement.\n"
msgstr "Misalkan sebuah partikel spin-0 meluruh menjadi dua partikel spin-1/2 A dan B. Apa yang paling baik menggambarkan keadaan partikel A sebelum pengukuran apapun.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "a. The spin of particle A is along $+z$.\n"
msgstr "a. Spin partikel A sepanjang $+z$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "b. The spin of particle A is along $-z$.\n"
msgstr "b. Spin partikel A sepanjang $-z$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "c. The spin of particle A is along $+x$.\n"
msgstr "c. Spin partikel A sepanjang $+x$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "d. The spin of particle A is defined along some directions, but not others.\n"
msgstr "d. Spin partikel A terdefinisi sepanjang beberapa arah, tetapi tidak yang lain.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "e. The spin orientation of particle A is undetermined by nature prior to any measurements.\n"
msgstr "e. Orientasi spin partikel A tidak ditentukan oleh alam sebelum pengukuran apapun.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Which of the following is/are true of the Hadamard gate? Select all that apply.\n"
msgstr "Mana dari berikut ini yang benar tentang Hadamard gate? Pilih semua yang berlaku.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "a. $H|0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)$\n"
msgstr "a. $H|0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "b. $H|0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)$\n"
msgstr "b. $H|0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "c. $H \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)=|0\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "c. $H \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)=|0\\rangle$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "d. $H \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)=|0\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "d. $H \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)=|0\\rangle$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Which of the following is/are true of the X gate? Select all that apply.\n"
msgstr "Mana dari berikut ini yang benar tentang X gate? Pilih semua yang berlaku.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "a. $X|0\\rangle = |1\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "a. $X|0\\rangle = |1\\rangle$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "b. $X|0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)$\n"
msgstr "b. $X|0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "c. $X|0\\rangle = -|0\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "c. $X|0\\rangle = -|0\\rangle$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "d. $X|1\\rangle = |0\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "d. $X|1\\rangle = |0\\rangle$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "e. $X\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)=X\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|1\\rangle-|0\\rangle)$\n"
msgstr "e. $X\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)=X\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|1\\rangle-|0\\rangle)$\n"

