# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Suppose a qubit is in the $|0\\rangle$ state. What is the probability of measuring it to be in the $1\\rangle$ state?\n"
msgstr "Misalkan sebuah qubit berada dalam keadaan $|0\\rangle$. Berapa probabilitas mengukurnya berada dalam keadaan $1\\rangle$?\n"

