#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "a. Exactly 100% on a noise-free simulator, near 100% on a real quantum computer\n"
msgstr "a. Tepat 100% pada simulator bebas noise, mendekati 100% pada komputer kuantum sungguhan\n"

